n="0:49.538" end="0:49.951">to</span></text><text for="L14"><span begin="0:50.258" end="0:51.870">sayonara to</span><span begin="0:51.870" end="0:52.907">tomo ni</span><span begin="0:52.907" end="0:54.597">owaru dake</span><span begin="0:54.597" end="0:55.061">nan</span><span begin="0:55.061" end="0:55.538">da</span></text><text for="L15"><span begin="0:55.547" end="0:56.525">shikata ga</span><span begin="0:56.525" end="0:57.261">nai yo</span><span begin="0:57.261" end="0:57.562">kit</span><span begin="0:57.562" end="0:57.939">to</span></text><text for="L16"><span begin="0:58.100" end="0:58.656">"okae</span><span begin="0:58.656" end="0:58.979">ri"</span></text><text for="L17"><span begin="0:59.059" end="0:59.589">omo</span><span begin="0:59.589" end="1:00.306">wazu</span><span begin="1:00.306" end="1:00.876">kobo</span><span begin="1:00.876" end="1:01.270">re</span><span begin="1:01.270" end="1:01.789">ta</span><span begin="1:01.789" end="1:02.248">kotoba</span><span begin="1:02.248" end="1:02.707">wa</span></text><text for="L18"><span begin="1:03.103" end="1:03.503">chiga</span><span begin="1:03.503" end="1:03.658">u</span><span begin="1:03.658" end="1:04.049">na</span></text><text for="L19"><span begin="1:14.390" end="1:15.134">hitori de</span><span begin="1:15.134" end="1:15.866">mukaeta</span><span begin="1:15.866" end="1:16.167">asa</span><span begin="1:16.167" end="1:16.536">ni</span></text><text for="L20"><span begin="1:17.102" end="1:17.583">futo</span><span begin="1:17.583" end="1:17.956">omou</span><span begin="1:17.956" end="1:18.306">dare</span><span begin="1:18.306" end="1:18.837">ka no ko</span><span begin="1:18.837" end="1:19.180">to</span></text><text for="L21"><span begin="1:19.754" end="1:20.490">futari de</span><span begin="1:20.490" end="1:21.157">sugoshita</span><span begin="1:21.157" end="1:21.471">hibi</span><span begin="1:21.471" end="1:21.794">no</span></text><text for="L22"><span begin="1:22.482" end="1:22.978">atari</span><span begin="1:2